(2667, 'atapoly', 'forestry-technology', 2, 'Forestry Technology', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry and any two (2) subjects from: Biology/Agricultural Science Technical Drawing, Basic Electronics/Basic Electricity, Auto Mechanics, Metal Work, Woodwork for Civil Engineering Technology, Further Mathematics English Language, Geography, Economics/Commerce. For Marine Engineering and Industrial Safety & Environmental Engineering. \'O\' Level pass in Biology is required. \'O\' Level credit pass in English Language is required.', 'Mathematics and any two (2) of Chemistry, Physics or Technical Drawing.', 2, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
