(9164, 'fedlokoja', 'sociology', 1, 'Sociology', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Two (2) \'A\' Level passes including Government or History.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in Government or History, English Language and three (3) other subjects. A pass in Mathematics is required.', 'Three (3) Social Science or Arts subjects.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9165, 'fedlokoja', 'biology', 1, 'Biology', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'i) Two (2) \'A\' Level passes from Chemistry, Biology, Botany/Zoology. (ii) NCE merit accepted.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes to include English Language, Biology, Chemistry and Mathematics/Physics.', 'Biology, Chemistry and Physics or Mathematics.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9177, 'aefuna', 'accounting', 1, 'Accounting', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '· ND Lower credit · Two (2) A\' level subjects including Accounting and either Economics or Business Management · JUPEB Special consideration B.Sc. with a minimum of 22 or HND with lower credit in any social science discipline Caveat: Candidate must meet O\' level requirements for direct entry.', 'Credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Economics, and anyone (1) social science and any one (1) science subject.', 'Use of English, Mathematics, Economics and any other social science subject.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9178, 'aefuna', 'business-administration', 1, 'Business Administration', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Two (2) \'A\' Level passes including Economics.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes including English Language, Mathematics, Economics and two (2) other relevant subjects.', 'Mathematics, Economics and any other Social Science subject', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9179, 'aefuna', 'chemical-engineering', 1, 'Chemical Engineering', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'i. Very good passes in three (3) JUPEB/A-Level subjects: Physics, Mathematics, Chemistry. ii. HND/ND Upper credit or A/Level Cambridge. iii. Candidate must satisfy the O\' level requirements', 'Credit Passes in English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry, Physics and Biology', 'Use of English, Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9180, 'aefuna', 'anatomy', 1, 'Anatomy', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'i. HSC (High School Certificate) ii. G.C.E. A-Level with Credit in Biology, Chemistry, and Physics. iii. A credit pass in A level in either JUPEB or IJAMB in Physics, Chemistry, and Biology.iv Credit passes in all the required O\' level subjects in addition to all the above.', 'Credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Physics, Biology, and Chemistry. (All obtained in one sitting)', 'Use of English, Biology, Chemistry and Physics', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9181, 'aefuna', 'agriculture', 1, 'Agriculture', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Two (2) \'A\' Level passes in Chemistry and one from Biology/Botany/Zoology/Agricultural Science, Economics, Physics, Geography and Geology/Mathematics (Pure & Applied).', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes to include English Language, Biology/Agricultural Science, Chemistry and any one of Mathematics, Physics, Geography and Economics.', 'Chemistry, Biology/Agriculture and any one of Physics or Mathematics.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9182, 'aefuna', 'civil-engineering', 1, 'Civil Engineering', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'i. Very good passes in three (3) JUPEB/A-Level subjects: Physics, Mathematics, Chemistry. ii. HND/ND Upper credit or A/Level Cambridge iii. Candidate must satisfy the O\' level requirements.', 'Credit Passes in English language, Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, and any other science subject.', 'Use of English, Mathematics, Physics, and Chemistry', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9183, 'aefuna', 'banking-and-finance', 1, 'Banking and Finance', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'ND Lower Credit Two (2) A\' Level Two(2) A\'Level Subjects one of which should be banking and finance or Accounting and either Economics or Business Management. JUPEB Special Consideration BSc with a minimum of 2-2 or HND with lower credit in any social science discipline Foundation international exams such as CIBN, ICAN, ACCA, ICMA GPFA……… CAVEATS Candidate must meet o\' level requirement for direct entry', 'Five (5) SSCE credit passes in English Language, Maths, economics and two Other relevant subjects', 'Mathematics, Economics and any other social science subject', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9184, 'aefuna', 'economics', 1, 'Economics', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Candidates seeking Direct Entry admission into the 200level of the B.Sc. Economics degree program shall possess any of the following qualifications: a. GCE Advanced level passes in at least two subjects which must include Economics. b. Acceptable passes in JUPEB or its equivalent; c. National Diploma Upper Credit or its equivalent in a related field. d. Higher National Diploma (HND) Lower Credit in a related field. e. NCE credit or its equivalent in related field; f. First degree in a related area from a', 'Credit Passes in English, Mathematics, Economics and any two relevant subjects from the following: Further mathematics, Government, Accounting, Geography, Lit. in English, Commerce, Book Keeping, Civic Education, History, CRK/IRK, any Nigerian Language/French, Physics, Chemistry', 'Use of English, Mathematics, Economics and any one of the Further Mathematics, Government, Accounting, Geography, Lit. in English, commerce, Book Keeping, Civic Education, History, CRK/IRK', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9185, 'aefuna', 'fisheries-and-aquaculture', 1, 'Fisheries and Aquaculture', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '(i) Two (2) \'A\' Level passes in any of Chemistry, Biology, Botany, Zoology, Agricultural Science, Geography, Mathematics (pure & applied), Physics, Geology and Economics. (ii) NCE Agriculture plus \'O\' level credit passes in at least 5 subjects prescribed for UTME. Holders of ND/OND and HND with a minimum of upper credit plus 5 credits in WASSCE / NECO/ GCE \'O\' level at a minimum of two attempts are eligible for consideration for admission into 200 and 300 Levels respectively.', 'Five (5) SSCE Credit passes in English Language, Biology/ Agricultural Science, Chemistry, Mathematics and physics/Geography/Economics.', 'Chemistry,Biology/Agricultural science and Mathematics/Physics', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9186, 'aefuna', 'education-and-chemistry', 1, 'Education and Chemistry', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'i. A pass at merit level in relevant Diploma Programme with SSCE requirements. ii. Advanced level passes in 2 relevant subjects with SSCE requirements. iii. NCE with at least merit pass in 2 relevant subjects or a double major subject with SSCE requirements. iv. IJMB passes in 2 relevant subjects with SSCE requirements. v. Any other equivalent qualifications with SSCE requirements. vi. Any other equivalent qualification as may be determined by the Department.', 'Credit Passes in English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry and any other two subjects from Physics, Biology and Agricultural Science.', 'Use of English, Chemistry and any other two subjects from Physics, Biology and Mathematics', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9187, 'aefuna', 'medicine-and-surgery', 1, 'Medicine and Surgery', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'i. i. i Minimum of 14 points pass in JUPEB Examination (From AE-FUNAI only) in addition to O\' level subjects. ii Minimum of second class upper (2:1) result for first-degree holders in relevant disciplines in addition to O\' level subjects and NYSC discharge certificate.', 'Credit passes in English language, Mathematics, Physics, Biology, and Chemistry. (All obtained in one sitting only)', 'Use of English, Biology, Physics, Chemistry.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9188, 'aefuna', 'criminology-and-security-studies', 1, 'Criminology and Security Studies', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'All candidates seeking admission by Direct Entry (DE) into the 200 Level must have Advanced Level or its approved equivalent with at least Credit level passes in at least two (2) social science subjects, one of which must be Government. Candidates with acceptable pass in JUBEB and Upper Credit in Ordinary National Diploma (OND) and Higher National Diploma (HND) from approved Polytechnic and Monotechnic Diploma-Awarding Institutions and/or their approved equivalent in the following disciplines: Peaceand Conflict Studies, Criminal Justice Administration, Paralegal Studies, Social Policy, Public Administration, Law, Security and Intelligence, and other related disciplines as well as First Degree in any discipline are also eligible for admission through DE, in addition to satisfying the O\'Level minimum requirements. In addition, a minimum of 12 years of practical experience in related fields such as military, police and other State law enforcement agencies, in addition to satisfying the basic O\'Level requirements, may be considered for admission into DE—the Officer must be in active service and not below the rank of Major or its equivalent.', 'For admission into the four-year-degree programme in Criminology and Security Studies, a candidate must have Senior Secondary School Certificate Examination (SSCE) or its equivalent with at least credit level passes in five (5) subjects: English Language, Mathematics, Government, and any other two subjects from: Geography, Economics, History, Civic Education, Financial Accounting, Biology, Chemistry, Physics, Christian Religious Knowledge, French, and Nigerian Languages (i.e. Hausa, Igbo or Yoruba) at not more than two sittings. The candidate must also earn an acceptable score in the Unified Tertiary Matriculation Examination (UTME).', 'The required UTME subjects are English Language, Government, and any other two subjects from either of Life/Health Sciences, Behavioural/Social Sciences or Arts/Humanities background.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(9189, 'aefuna', 'physiology', 1, 'Physiology', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'i. HSC (High School College). ii. G.C.E. A level with credit in Biology, Chemistry, and Physics. iii. A credit pass in A level in either JUPEB or IJAMB in physics, Chemistry, and Biology.iv In addition to all the above a credit pass in all the required O\' level subjects is needed.', 'Credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Physics, Biology, and Chemistry. (All obtained in one sitting only).', 'Use of English, Biology, Physics, and Chemistry.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
