(9239, 'aefuna', 'educational-management', 1, 'Educational Management', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Candidates for Direct Entry admission into three years degree programme in Educational Management will join the programme at 200 level. They would possess any of the following qualifications in addition to the basic university admission requirements of the subject area departments whose courses would be considered as restricted electives.1.Two passes in relevant subject areas at advanced level, with SSCE/GCE \"O\" level credit pass in 5 subjects including English and Mathematics at not more than two sittings, OR2. A two year diploma of a recognized institution in Nigeria or overseas with pass level not below merit.3. At least a merit pass in two major subjects in relevant areas at NCE from recognized institution in Nigeria or overseas.', 'Five (5) SSCE credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, and three other relevant subjects', 'Economics, Mathematics and one (1) other Social Science/Arts subject.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
