(11056, 'globalpoly', 'statistics', 2, 'Statistics', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in Mathematics, Basic Science and any three (3) of the following: Economics, Geography, Government/History, Further Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, Biology/Agricultural Science. English Language, Typewriting, \'O\' Level credit passes in English Language and Physics are compulsory.', 'Any of the three (3): 1. Economics/ Commerce 2. History/Government 3. CRS/IS 4. Mathematics', 2, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
