(17341, 'nbpz', 'building-technology', 2, 'Building Technology', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in Mathematics and Physics and any three (3) of the following: Economics/Commerce, Technical Drawing/Fine Art, Chemistry, Geography, Further Mathematics Woodwork, Biology, Religious Knowledge, Metal Work, And at least a credit pass in English Language is Compulsory. A pass in Art or Technical Drawing will be an advantage.', 'Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry or Fine Arts.', 2, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
