(19821, 'adokapoly', 'computer-engineering-technology', 2, 'Computer Engineering Technology', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry and any two (2) subjects from: Biology/Agricultural Science Technical Drawing, Basic Electronics/Basic Electricity, Auto Mechanics, Metal Work, Woodwork (for Civil Engineering Tech.), Further Mathematics English Language, Geography, Economics/Commerce. For Marine Engineering and Industrial Safety & Environmental Engineering a pass in Biology is required. \'O\' Level credit pass in English Language is required.', 'Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry.', 2, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
