(23363, 'dssmarine', 'nautical-science', 2, 'Nautical Science', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in English Language is required. Mathematics, Physics, Geography and two (2) others from Chemistry, Economics/Commerce, Biology/Agricultural Science, Woodwork, Metalwork, Foreign Language, Technical Drawing, Basic Electricity. Plus five (5) SSC credit pass in English Language.', 'Any three (3) of Geography, Physics, Mathematics, Technical Drawing and Economics', 2, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23364, 'dssmarine', 'maritime-transport-and-business-studies', 2, 'Maritime Transport and Business Studies', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in English Language, not Literature in English and Mathematics and any three (3) subjects from the following: Economics/Commerce, Business Methods, Principles of Accounts, Literature in English Geography Office Practice Biology/Agricultural Science, Chemistry, Physics, History/Government Typewriting Shorthand', 'Mathematics and two (2) of Geography, Commerce, Government, Principles of Accounts and Economics', 2, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23366, 'fedpobal', 'agricultural-and-bioenvironmental-engineering-technology', 2, 'Agricultural and Bioenvironmental Engineering Technology', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The general entry requirement for the HND programme includes 1. ﻿1. All the requirement for admission into the ND Agric and Bio-environmental Engineering Technology 2. ﻿2. A minimum of lower credit pass (CGPA 2.50 and above) in the ND Agric and Bio-environmental Engineering Technology 3. A minimum of one year post ND cognate work experience, Where a candidate has a pass, he shall have not less than three (3) years of cognate work experience.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in Mathematics, English Language, Physics and any two (2) of the following: Biology/Agricultural Science Chemistry Technical Drawing Basic Electronics/Basic Electricity Auto Mechanics Metal Work Further Mathematics Food and Nutrition Geography', 'Mathematics and Physics/Technical Drawing, Chemistry or any two (2) Science subjects.', 2, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23367, 'fedpobal', 'building-technology', 2, 'Building Technology', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Candidates with qualifications as listed below shall be considered for admissions into the programme: 1. ﻿1. The minimum entry requirements for ND programme in Building Technology. 2. ﻿2. National Diploma in Building Technology only with (CGPA 2.50 and above). 3. ﻿3. A minimum of one year Post-National Diploma cognate work experience where a candidate has a minimum of lower credit. Where a candidate has a pass, he shall have not less than three (3) years of cognate work experience.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in Mathematics and Physics and any three (3) of the following: Economics/Commerce, Technical Drawing/Fine Art, Chemistry, Geography, Further Mathematics Woodwork, Biology, Religious Knowledge, Metal Work, And at least a credit pass in English Language is Compulsory. A pass in Art or Technical Drawing will be an advantage.', 'Use of English, Physics, Mathematics, and any of Chemistry, Geography, Art, Biology and Economics.', 2, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23368, 'fedpobal', 'animal-health-and-production-technology', 2, 'Animal Health and Production Technology', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Candidates with qualifications as listed below shall be considered for admissions into the programme: 1. ﻿1. The minimum entry requirements for ND programme in Animal Health and Production Technology. 2. ﻿2. National Diploma in Animal Health and Production Technology only with (CGPA 2,50 and above). 3. ﻿3. A minimum of one year Post-National Diploma cognate work experience where a candidate has a minimum of lower credit. Where a candidate has a pass, he shall have not less than three (3) years of cognate work experience.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in Biology/Agricultural Science, Mathematics and any three (3) of the following: Geography, Food and Nutrition, Economics, Technical Drawing, English Language, Physics, Chemistry, Nigerian Language, Home Economics. At least \'O\' level credit passes in English Language and Chemistry are compulsory.', 'Biology/Agricultural Science, Chemistry and any other Science subject', 2, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23369, 'fedpobal', 'civil-engineering-technology', 2, 'Civil Engineering Technology', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Candidates with qualifications as listed below shall be considered for admissions into the programme: 1. ﻿1. The minimum entry requirements for ND programme in Civil Engineering Technology. 2. ﻿2. National Diploma in Civil Enginnering Technology only with (CGPA 2.50 and Above). 3. ﻿3. A minimum of one year Post-National Diploma cognate work experience where a candidate has a minimum of lower credit. Where a candidate has a pass, he shall have not less than three (3) years of cognate work experience.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry and any two (2) subjects from: Biology/Agricultural Science Technical Drawing, Basic Electronics/Basic Electricity, Auto Mechanics, Metal Work, Woodwork for Civil Engineering Technology, Further Mathematics English Language, Geography, Economics/Commerce. For Marine Engineering and Industrial Safety & Environmental Engineering a pass in Biology is required. At least \'O\' level credit pass in English Language is required.', 'Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry.', 2, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23370, 'fedpobal', 'computer-engineering-technology', 2, 'Computer Engineering Technology', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The general entry requirement for the HND programme includes 1. ﻿1. All the requirement for admission into the ND Computer Engineering programme 2. ﻿2. A minimum of lower credit pass (CGPA 2.50 and above) in the ND examination in Electrical/ Electronic Engineering Technology 3. ﻿3. A minimum of one year post ND cognate work experience', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry and any two (2) subjects from: Biology/Agricultural Science Technical Drawing, Basic Electronics/Basic Electricity, Auto Mechanics, Metal Work, Woodwork (for Civil Engineering Tech.), Further Mathematics English Language, Geography, Economics/Commerce. For Marine Engineering and Industrial Safety & Environmental Engineering a pass in Biology is required. \'O\' level credit pass in English Language is required.', 'Mathematics, physics and Chemistry.', 2, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23371, 'fedpobal', 'electrical-electronics-engineering-technology', 2, 'Electrical / Electronics Engineering Technology', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The general entry requirement for the HND programme includes 1. ﻿1. All the requirement for admission into the ND Electrical/ Electronic Engineering Technology programme 2. ﻿2. A minimum of lower credit pass (CGPA 2.50 and above) in the ND examination in Electrical/ Electronic Engineering Technology 3. ﻿3. A minimum of one year post ND cognate work experience', 'Five (5) \'O\' level credit passes in Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry and any two (2) subjects from: Biology/Agricultural Science Technical Drawing, Basic Electronics/Basic Electricity, Auto Mechanics, Metal Work, Woodwork (for Civil Engineering Tech.), Further Mathematics English Language, Geography, Economics/Commerce. For Marine Engineering and Industrial Safety & Environmental Engineering. \'O\' level pass in Biology is required. At least \'O\' level credit pass in English Language is required.', 'Mathematics, physics, Chemistry.', 2, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23372, 'fedpobal', 'business-administration-and-management', 2, 'Business Administration and Management', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'The general entry requirement for HND in Business Administration and Management are; 1. ﻿1. All the requirement for admission into ND programme in BAM 2. ﻿2. A minimum of lower credit pass (CGPA 2.50 and above) in ND Business Studies or related programme 3. ﻿3. A minimum of one year post-ND cognate work experience', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in English Language, not Literature in English and Mathematics and any three (3) subjects from the following: Economics/Commerce, Business Methods, Principles of Accounts, Literature in English Geography Office Practice Biology/Agricultural Science, Chemistry, Physics, History/Government, Typewriting Shorthand', 'Mathematics and two (2) of Geography, Commerce, Government, Principles of Accounts and Economics.', 2, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23373, 'fedpobal', 'public-administration-and-management', 2, 'Public Administration and Management', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A candidate for Higher National Diploma programme in Public Administration must be a holder of an accredited ND in Public Administration or any other equivalent qualification approved by NBTE. Such a Candidate must have obtained a (CGPA 2.50 and above). In addition, the candidate must have completed at least one year post-ND cognate work experience. It is also essential that such a candidate have also met the entry requirement for admission into ND Public Administration programme.', 'Five (5) \'O\' level credit passes in English Language not Literature in English and Mathematics and any three (3) subjects of the following Economics/Commerce, Business Methods, Principles of Accounts, Literature in English Geography, Office Practice Government, Biology/Agricultural Science, Chemistry, Physics,', 'Government, Economics and any other subject.', 2, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23374, 'nbpz', 'surveying-and-geoinformatics', 2, 'Surveying and Geoinformatics', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in Mathematics ,Physics , English Language and anyother two (2) subjects from the following: Further Mathematics, Chemistry; Technical Drawing/Fine Art, Geography, Economics/Commerce, Biology/Agricultural Science Basic Land Surveying or Basic Electricity. At least \'O\' Level credit pass in English Language is compulsory', 'Any three (3) of English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry/Physics, Biology/Agricultural Science and Economics.', 'English Language, Mathematics, Physics plus any Science Subject.', 2, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23375, 'uyo', 'crop-science', 1, 'Crop Science', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Two (2) \'A\' Level passes in Chemistry and one from Biology/Botany/Zoology/Agricultural Science, Economics, Physics, Geography and Geology/Mathematics (Pure & Applied)...', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes to include English Language, Biology/Agricultural Science, Chemistry and any one of Mathematics, Physics, Geography and Economics....', 'Chemistry, Biology/Agriculture and any one of Physics or Mathematics', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23376, 'uyo', 'geology', 1, 'Geology', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'At least two (2) \'A\' level passes at GCE/NABTEB/IJMB/JUPEB or equivalent in any of; Mathematics, Physics Chemistry, Biology (Botany or Zoology) and Geography. At least Credit Pass at ND in any of; Mathematics, Physics Chemistry, Biology (Botany or Zoology) and Geography. In addition to UTME requirements', 'Five \'O\' level credit passes to include English Language and Mathematics and any other three (3) subjects from Biology, Chemistry, Physics and Geography.', 'English Language and any three (3) of Biology, Chemistry, Physics, Mathematics and Geography.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23377, 'uyo', 'geophysics', 1, 'Geophysics', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'At least two (2) \'A\' level passes at GCE/NABTEB/IJMB/JUPEB or equivalent in any of; Mathematics, Physics Chemistry, Biology (Botany or Zoology) and Geography. At least Credit Pass at ND in any of; Mathematics, Physics Chemistry, Biology (Botany or Zoology) and Geography. In addition to UTME requirements', 'Five \'O\' level credit passes to include English Language and Mathematics and any other three (3) subjects from Biology, Chemistry, Physics and Geography.', 'English Language and any three (3) of Mathematics, Physics Chemistry, Biology and Geography', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23378, 'uyo', 'human-nutrition-and-dietetics', 1, 'Human Nutrition and Dietetics', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'At least two (2) \'A\' level passes at GCE/NABTEB/IJMB/JUPEB or equivalent in any of; Chemistry, Biology (Botany or Zoology) Agricultural Science, Mathematics or Physics. At least Credit Pass at ND in any of; Chemistry, Biology (Botany or Zoology) Agricultural Science, Mathematics or Physics. In addition to UTME requirements', 'Five \'O\' level credit passes to include English Language and Mathematics and any other three (3) subjects from Chemistry, Biology or Food and Nutrition or Agricultural Science and Physics or Mathematics.', 'English Language and any three (3) of Chemistry, Biology, Food and Nutrition, Agricultural Science, Physics or Mathematics.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23379, 'uyo', 'insurance', 1, 'Insurance', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'At least two (2) \'A\' level passes at GCE/NABTEB/IJMB/JUPEB or equivalent from; Economics, Finance, Accounting or Management. At least Upper Credit Pass at ND in any of; Economics, Finance, Accounting or Management. At least Lower Credit Pass at HND in any of; Economics, Finance, Accounting or Management. In addition to UTME requirements', 'Five \'O\' level credit passes to include English Language and Mathematics and Economics any other two (2) subjects.', 'Economics, Mathematics and any other Relevant subject', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23380, 'fssoyo', 'computer-science', 2, 'Computer Science', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in Mathematics, a basic science and three (3) other subjects chosen from the following: Economics, Geography, Government/History, Further Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, Biology/Agricultural Science. English Language, Typewriting, \'O\' Level credit passes in English Language and Physics is compulsory.', 'Mathematics and any two (2) of Geography, Physics, Economics or Chemistry.', 2, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
