(23544, 'fedpoado', 'horticultural-technology', 2, 'Horticultural Technology', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NIL', 'The Minimum entry requirements into National Diploma (ND) in Horticultural Technology are Five (5) Credits passes in WASC/ NECO/GCE O\'level/ SSCE/NABTEB- National Technical Certificate (NTC): Examination at not more than two (2) sittings. The subjects must include: 1. Mathematics; 2. English language; 3. Chemistry; 4. Agricultural Science/Biology/Animal Husbandry; 5. Plus any one (1) of the following: Geography, Economics. Technical Drawing, Physics, Fine Art, Food and Nutrition/Home Management/Clothing and Textile/Home Economics, Forestry, Data Processing/ICT/Computer Studies NOTE: Only NABTEB National Technical Certificate (NTC) would be accepted for admission and not NABTEB National Business Certificate (NBC)', '- English Language; - Mathematics; - Chemistry; - Any one (1) from Physics, Technical Drawing, Biology.', 2, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
