(23732, 'ajayi', 'civil-engineering', 1, 'Civil Engineering', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'In addition to Five (5) SSC credit passes at notmore than two sittings requirement, the Candidate should possess one of the following: i) passes from Chemistry, Physics, and Mathematics ii) ND lower credit in Civil Engineering for admission into 200 level.iii) HND lower credit in Civil Engineering for admission into 300 level.iv) Students may be allowed to transfer into 200 or 300 level provided:- they satisfy the University Conditions for transfer.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes at not more than one sittings to include Physics, Chemistry, Mathematics, English Language and one other relevant Science Subject from Biology, Agricultural Science, Technical Drawing, Further Mathematics, etc. in the SSCE or its approved equivalent by Federal Ministry of Education. The candidate must have an acceptable pass mark in the UTME.', 'Physics, Chemistry and Mathematics', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
