(23747, 'mcpherson', 'nursing', 1, 'Nursing', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '(i) Two (2) \'A\' Level passes in Biology/ Zoology, Chemistry and Physics plus three (3) other \'O\' Level credit passes in Mathematics, Physics and English Language. (ii) NRN or its approved equivalent plus five (5) \'O\' Level credit passes in English Language and four (4) Science subjects chosen from Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, Biology, Human Anatomy, Physiology and Hygiene, Health Science, Further Mathematics and General Science.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in Mathematics, Chemistry, Biology, Physics and English Language.', 'Physics, Chemistry and Biology.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23748, 'mountaintop', 'physics-with-electronics', 1, 'Physics with Electronics', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'For Direct Entry (DE), candidates must have passes in Mathematics and Physics or Chemistry at GCE \'A\' level or equivalent. Holders of OND and HND at minimum of Lower credit level are eligible for consideration for admission into 200 level or 300 level. The Department of Physics shall consider the transcript of the candidate to appropriately place the candidate.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in English Language, Physics, Chemistry and any one of Further Mathematics, Biology, Economics, Geography, Technical Drawing and Agricultural Science.', 'English Language, Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry or any other science subject.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23749, 'mountaintop', 'geology', 1, 'Geology', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Direct Entry candidates must fulfil the conditions in O\' Level requirements and have a minimum of Lower Credit at the ND Examination or equivalent from a recognized institution or G.C.E (Advanced Level) or equivalent in at least two science subjects including Physics and Chemistry to qualify for admission into 200 level of the programme. Holders of HND at minimum of Lower Credit in relevant discipline are eligible for consideration for admission into 300 level.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in English Language, Biology, Chemistry, Mathematics and any other Science subject.', 'The University Tertiary Matriculation Examination (UTME) subject requirements include: English language, Physics, Chemistry and Biology/ any Science subject.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23750, 'mountaintop', 'industrial-chemistry', 1, 'Industrial Chemistry', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Students with an Ordinary National Diploma from an accredited polytechnic or other equivalent institutions, will be considered for admission provided they graduated from the respective institutions with a minimum of Lower Credit grade (or its equivalent) in addition to fulfilling the O\' Level subject requirement listed above. Candidates with Advanced Level results with at least a credit (Grade C) in Chemistry in addition to pass in two others subjects including Mathematics and/or Physics or any Biological or Agricultural Science subjects may be considered for admission through direct entry into second year. Holders of HND at minimum of Lower Credit in relevant discipline are eligible for consideration for admission into 300 level.', 'The prospective candidates must have a minimum of five credits in Mathematics, English Language, Chemistry, Physics and any other relevant science subjects at the Ordinary level (O\' Levels) Senior Secondary School Certificate Examinations', 'Chemistry, Mathematics and any of Physics/Biology/ Agricultural Science.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23751, 'mountaintop', 'securities-and-investment', 1, 'Securities and Investment', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Two (2) \'A\' Level passes chosen from Accounting, Economics, Management, Mathematics, Geography and Statistics.To qualify for entry into the 3-year programme for the award of a B.Sc. Degree in Securities and Investments, a candidate must fulfil the following:a. Possess Five O\' level credit passes at not more than two sittings including English Language, Mathematics, Economics and any other two subjects from the following: Geography, Biology, Commerce, Government, Account and Book-keeping at not more than two sittings.b. Possess two A\' Level passes in the relevant commercial courses acceptable to the University such as Economics, Geography and Government.c. Possess Ordinary National Diploma Lower Credit in relevant courses including Accounting, Finance, Insurance, Banking and other Financial Studies courses. d. Possess National Certificate of Education, Merit in relevant courses including Accounting, Finance, Insurance, Banking and other Financial Studies courses. e. Holders of HND at minimum of lower credit in relevant discipline are eligible for consideration for admission into 300 level.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes to include: English Language, Mathematics and any other subjects. For NBC, the other two (2) relevant subjects could be from any of the following; Accounting, Principles of Accounts, Commerce, Office Practice and Economics.', 'Candidates are expected to take English Language, Mathematics, and any other two subjects.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23752, 'panatlantic', 'computer-science', 1, 'Computer Science', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '(i) Two (2) \'A\' Level passes in science subjects including Mathematics (ii) NCE merit in Mathematics and one (1) other Science or Social Science subject.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics, Physics plus two (2) other Science subjects.', 'Mathematics, Physics and one (1) of Biology, Chemistry, Agric Science, Economics and Geography.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23753, 'panatlantic', 'electrical-electronics-engineering', 1, 'Electrical / Electronics Engineering', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Two (2) \'A\' Level passes in Mathematics, Physics or Chemistry', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes to include Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, English Language and any other Science subject.', 'Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23754, 'panatlantic', 'mechanical-engineering', 1, 'Mechanical Engineering', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '(i) Two (2) \'A\' Level passes from Chemistry, Physics and Mathematics. (ii) ND upper credit, NCE technical and HND in Mech. Engineering.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes to include Physics, Chemistry, Mathematics, English Language and any other Science subject.', 'Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23755, 'redeemers', 'civil-engineering', 1, 'Civil Engineering', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '(i) \'A\' Level passes in Physics and Mathematics. (ii) ND/HND upper credit at appropriate levels.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes to include Physics, Chemistry, Mathematics, English Language and one Science subject', 'Physics, Chemistry and Mathematics', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23756, 'redeemers', 'mechanical-engineering', 1, 'Mechanical Engineering', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '(i) Two (2) \'A\' Level passes from Chemistry, Physics and Mathematics. (ii) ND upper credit, NCE technical and HND in Mech. Engineering.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes to include Physics, Chemistry, Mathematics, English Language and any other Science subject.', 'Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23757, 'redeemers', 'electrical-electronics-engineering', 1, 'Electrical / Electronics Engineering', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Two (2) \'A\' Level passes in Mathematics, Physics or Chemistry', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes to include Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, English Language and any other Science subject.', 'Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23758, 'redeemers', 'computer-engineering', 1, 'Computer Engineering', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Three (3) \'A\' Level passes in Pure Mathematics or Pure and Applied Mathematics, Chemistry and Physics.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes to include Mathematics, Further Mathematics, Chemistry, Physics and English Language.', 'Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23759, 'redeemers', 'building-technology', 1, 'Building Technology', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '\'A\' Level passes in Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in Mathematics, English Language, Physics, Chemistry and any one of Geography, Economics, Arts and Technical drawing. For holders of NTC, the other relevant subjects could be Intro. to Building Construction, Bricklaying, Concreting, Walls, Floors and Ceiling Finishing, Building/Engineering Drawing, Joinery, Carpentry, Gas, Steam Work and Bronze Welding, Cold / Hot Water Supply, Sanitation and Drainage.', 'Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23760, 'redeemers', 'estate-management', 1, 'Estate Management', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Two (2) \'A\' Level passes in Mathematics, Economics, Geography, Biology and Physics.', 'Five (5) SSCE credit passes including Chemistry, Mathematics and English Language.', 'Mathematics, Economics and one other subject', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23761, 'redeemers', 'quantity-surveying', 1, 'Quantity Surveying', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '(i) Two (2) \'A\' Level passes chosen from Mathematics or Physics and Chemistry, Geography or Fine Arts. (ii) ND/HND upper credits in relevant field.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry and any of Fine Art, Geography or Wood Work, Biology, Economics, Technical Drawing, Further. Mathematics., Introduction to Building Construction, Bricklaying/Block laying, Concreting, Wall, Floors and Ceiling Finishing, Joinery, Carpentary, Decorative Painting, Lining, Sign and Design, Wall Hanging, Colour Mixing/Matching and Glazing, Ceramics, Graphics Design, Graphic Printing, Basic Electricity.', 'Physics, Mathematics, and any of Chemistry, Geography, Art, Biology and Economics.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23762, 'redeemers', 'surveying-and-geoinformatics', 1, 'Surveying and Geoinformatics', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '(i) Two (2) \'A\' Level passes chosen from Mathematics or Physics and Chemistry, Geography or Fine Arts. (ii) ND/HND upper credits in relevant field.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry and any of Fine Art, Geography or Wood Work, Biology, Economics, Technical Drawing, Further. Mathematics., Introduction to Building Construction, Bricklaying/Block laying, Concreting, Wall, Floors and Ceiling Finishing, Joinery, Carpentary, Decorative Painting, Lining, Sign and Design, Wall Hanging, Colour Mixing/Matching and Glazing, Ceramics, Graphics Design, Graphic Printing, Basic Electricity.', 'Physics, Mathematics, and any of Chemistry, Geography, Art, Biology and Economics.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(23763, 'redeemers', 'urban-and-regional-planning', 1, 'Urban and Regional Planning', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '(i) Two (2) A\' LEVEL passes in Geography and Mathematics (ii) ND/HND upper credit in Town Planning or related programmes plus UTME requirements are accepted.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Geography, and any two (2) of Physics, Chemistry, Economics, Government, Biology, Art, History, IRK/CRK, Social Studies and Tech Drawing.', 'Mathematics, Geography and one of Economics, Physics, Chemistry.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
