(24920, 'futo', 'information-technology', 1, 'Information Technology', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'FUTO requires: i. At least two \'A\' level passes not below Grade C in Mathematics, Chemistry and Physicsii. ND/HND at Credit level in Physics, Chemistry, Mathematics, Statistics, Computer Science, Geology or Engineering.iii. First Degree in Physics, Mathematics, Statistics, Chemistry, Geology or Engineering.iv. Very good passes in three JUPEB subjects namely Chemistry, Physics and Mathematics. Candidates must in addition meet the \'O\' Level requirements. FUTO does not accept NCE', 'At least five O\' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry, Physics and any other science subject in not more than two sittings.', 'Mathematics, Chemistry and Physics', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24921, 'futo', 'cyber-security', 1, 'Cyber Security', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'i. At least two \'A\' level passes not below Grade C in Mathematics and Physicsii. ND/HND at Upper Credit level in Physics, Chemistry, Mathematics, Statistics, Computer Science, Geology or Engineering.iii. First Degree in Physics, Mathematics, Statistics, Chemistry, Geology or Engineering.iv. Very good passes in three JUPEB subjects namely Chemistry, Physics and Mathematics. It does not accept NCE. Candidates must in addition meet the \'O\' Level requirements', 'At least five O\' Level credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry, Physics and any other science subject in not more than two sittings. At least a Pass is required in Biology.', 'English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry and Physics', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24923, 'futo', 'medicine-and-surgery', 1, 'Medicine and Surgery', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'FUTO requires: i. At least three \'A\' level passes not below Grade C in Biology, Chemistry and Physics/Mathematics. ii. First Degree with at least second Class Lower Division in Basic Medical sciences, Biological and Physical Sciences, Agriculture or Engineering. iv. Very good passes in three JUPEB subjects namely Chemistry, Biology and Physics Candidates must in addition meet the \'O\' Level requirements. FUTO does not accept NCE', 'At least five O\' Level Credit passes in English Language, Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry and Biology in one sitting', 'Physics, Chemistry and Biology.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24924, 'futo', 'forensic-science', 1, 'Forensic Science', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'FUTO requires: i. At least two \'A\' Level passes not below Grade C in Chemistry and any from Biology, Zoology and Botany. ii. ND/HND at Credit level in life sciences iii. First Degree in life sciences. iv. Very good passes in three JUPEB subjects namely Chemistry, Biology and Physics/Mathematics Candidates must in addition meet the \'O\' Level requirements. FUTO does not accept NCE', 'Five O\' level credit passes in English Language, Chemistry, Mathematics, Physics and Biology in not more than two sittings.', 'Biology, Chemistry and Physics/Mathematics.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24931, 'fedfishlag', 'hydrology-and-water-resources-management', 2, 'Hydrology and Water Resources Management', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NIL', 'i. Five (5) ordinary credit pass at SSCE/GCE/NECO/NABTEB obtained at not more than two (2) sittings which must include English, Mathematics, physics or Geography and any other two (2) Science subjects plus at least pass in Chemistry and Biology. ii. Five credit pass in NBTE recognised preliminary National Diploma (ND) course offered in a college of Agriculture or similar post secondary. Technical institution. The credit pass must include Mathematics, Geography and physics.', 'English Language, Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry.', 2, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(24932, 'fedfishlag', 'oceanography-and-fisheries-science', 2, 'Oceanography and Fisheries Science', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'NIL', 'I. Five (5) ordinary credit pass at SSCE/GCE/NECO/NABTEB obtained at not more than two sittings which must include English, Mathematics, Chemistry and any two other subjects. ii. Five credit pass in relevant subjects obtained at final examination of an NBTE recognised preliminary ND programme offered in a college of Agriculture or similar post secondary Technical Institutions such students must have Olevel WASC, SSCE, or GCE Pass in Biology/Agricultural Science, Geography, Chemstry, Mathematics and English Language.', 'English Language, Mathematics, Geography and Biology.', 2, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
