(25919, 'pru', 'public-administration', 1, 'Public Administration', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Two (2) \'A-Level passes were chosen from Economics, Accounting, Business Management, Government, and Geography.', 'Five (5) SSCE credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics, Economics, and any other two (2) other relevant subjects from any of Principles of Accounts, Commerce, Office Practice, and Secretarial Studies.', 'Mathematics, Economics plus any Social Science subject.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25920, 'pru', 'international-relations', 1, 'International Relations', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Two (2) \'A-Level passes in any of the following subjects: Government, Economics, History, and French.', 'Five (5) SSC credit passes to include English Language, Government, and Mathematics and any other two (2) relevant subjects.', 'Mathematics and any two (2) of the following: Economics, History, Government, Geography, Literature in English, Commerce, History, and French.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25922, 'pru', 'business-administration', 1, 'Business Administration', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Two (2) \'A-Level passes were chosen from Economics, Accounting, Business Management, Government, and Geography.', 'Five (5) SSCE credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics, Economics, and any other two (2) other subjects. For NBC holders, the other two (2) relevant subjects could be from any of the Principles of Accounts, Commerce, Office Practice, and Secretarial Duties.', 'Mathematics, Economics plus any Social Science subject.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25923, 'pru', 'procurement-management', 1, 'Procurement Management', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Two (2) \'A-Level passes chosen from Economics, Accounting, Business Management, Government, and Geography.', 'Five (5) SSCE credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics, Economics, and any other two (2) other subjects. For NBC holders, the other two (2) relevant subjects could be from any of the Principles of Accounts, Commerce, Office Practice, and Secretarial Duties.', 'Mathematics, Economics plus any Social Science subject.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25924, 'pru', 'accounting', 1, 'Accounting', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Two (2) \'A-Level passes chosen from Economics, Accounting, Business Management, Government, and Geography.', 'Five (5) SSCE credit passes to include English Language, Mathematics, Economics and any other two (2) Subjects in relevant subjects could be from any of Principles of Accounts, Commerce, Office Practice, and Secretarial studies.', 'Mathematics, Economics plus any Social Science subject.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25926, 'atibauni', 'hotel-management-and-tourism', 1, 'Hotel Management and Tourism', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '(a) AUO Diploma with at least Credit Pass in Hospitality Management, Culinary Arts or Tourism Management(b) Two (2) A Level passes or equivalents in Economics, Mathematics, Geography/Accounting (c) HND/ND in Catering and Hotel Management or Tourism and Leisure Management with a Minimum of Upper Credit(d) NCE with distinction or credit in Home Economics and any other related subjects (e) BSc in other discipline with at least Pass', 'Five (5) credit passes including English Language, Mathematics, Economics and any relevant subjects in the Arts/sciences/social sciences domain', 'Mathematics, Economics, English Language and any other social science subject', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25927, 'iaued', 'marketing', 1, 'Marketing', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2 \'A\' level (GCE) Subjects at credit pass in relevant subjects or NCE/OND at credit pass', '5 \'O\' level subjects. i.e. WACE or NECO/GCE at credit level which includes English, Mathematics, Economics or Commerce, Government, Christian Religious Knowledge or Marketing.', 'English, Mathematics, Government, Economics', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25928, 'iaued', 'accounting', 1, 'Accounting', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Candidates seeking admission by direct entry are expected to possess, in addition to credit level passes in English Language, Mathematics, Economics or Commerce and any two from the following subjects: Government, Book-Keeping, Accounting, History, CRK, Business Methods, Typewriting, Literature in English, Biology, at least credit in National Diploma certificate or three year NCE programme width passes in Accounting and or related subject areas such as Finance, Banking, Marketing and Management.', 'Five (5) O\'level credits in English Language, Mathematics, Economics/Commerce and any other two subjects from Government, Book-Keeping, Accounting, History, C.R.K, Business Methods, Typewriting, Literature in English, Biology etc', 'English Language, Mathematics, Economics and Government.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25929, 'iaued', 'office-and-information-management', 1, 'Office and Information Management', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '1. In addition to O\'Level requirements stipulated above, applicants should possess at leastTwo A\' Level papers in relevant commercial subjects on a grade of at least \'B\'. 2. ND in relevant discipline with at least upper credit grade in addition to the five credit passes as in UTME requirements above. 3. HND in relevant discipline with at least lower credit in addition to five credit passes as in UTME requirements above.', 'In addition to UTME subjects, the prospective candidate for a 4-year degree programme is expected to have obtained credit passes in five Senior Secondary Certificate (SSC) subjects or its equivalent including English Language and Mathematics with any other three (3) from Principles of Accounting, Commerce, Economics/other WAEC/NECO commercial subjects at not more than two sittings', 'English Language, Mathematics, Economics, Commerce', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25930, 'iaued', 'adult-education-and-community-development', 1, 'Adult Education and Community Development', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Merits or credits in 3 subjects areas in NCE, GCE A\'Levels, OND etc. A minimum of 5 O\'Level credit passes in not more than 2 sittings BUT no subject shall be counted at both the ordinary and Advance O\'Levels.', 'SSCE/GCE O\'Level with credit in 5 subjects which must include English Language and Mathematics Or TCII certificate with credit or merit in 3 subjects but credit/merit are required in English Language and Mathematics.', 'English Language, Mathematics and any other two subjects', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25931, 'iaued', 'management', 1, 'Management', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Candidates seeking admission by Direct Entry must have higher level qualifications such as GCE A\' level or equivalent, NCE, ND, HND with the appropriate classification provided. Candidates also satisfy the general entry requirements for admission into the University. In addition, candidates must satisfy the department entry requirements.', 'For admission by UTME entry into the department of Management for first degree programme must possess the minimum qualification of senior secondary school certificate SSCE, or its equivalent with the following credits.Level passes in five (5) subjects to include 1. English language2. MathematicsAnd three other subjects like Economics, Government History, Commerce, Business Methods, Accounting, Geography, CRK, Civic Education.', 'Mathematics, Economics, plus one of Government History Geography, CRK, Commerce, Civic Education.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25940, 'ilorin', 'woodwork-technology-education', 1, 'Woodwork Technology Education', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '(i) Two (2) \'A\' Level passes in Physics and Mathematics.(ii) ND lower credit in Civil Engineering, Production/Electrical Engineering.(iii) Final City and Guilds or its equivalent plus National Technical Certificate.(iv) NCE credit in Technical Education plus \'O\' Level credit passes in Physics or Mathematics.', 'Five (5) \'O\' Level credit passes to include Physics or Mathematics.', 'Mathematics, Physics and one (1) other Science subject.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(25941, 'ilorin', 'social-work', 1, 'Social Work', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'a. B.Sc. (Hons.) in Social Sciences, Humanities or Nursing with a third Class degree. b. Two A Level subject passes in Social Sciences and Humanities in addition to UTME O\' Level requirements.', 'At least five (5) credit passes including English language, Mathematics and One (1) Social Science, others subjects in Arts/Social Sciences/Science', 'Atleast one Social Science', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
