(26102, 'kwasu', 'food-engineering', 1, 'Food Engineering', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Direct Entry Admission is to either the 200 Level or 300 Level depending on the qualification of the candidate. i) For admission into 200 Level, the candidate must satisfy the following requirements: a) Obtain Ordinary Level (O\'Level) passes at least at credit level in not more than two sittings in at least five subjects including English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry, Physics and either Agricultural Science or Biology. b) At least two Advanced Level passes in Mathematics, Physics and Chemistry. OR c) National Diploma (ND) with a minimum of Upper Credit (minimum) from a recognized Institution with one year Industrial Attachment Certificate. ii) For admission to 300 Level, the candidate must satisfy the following requirements: a) Obtain Ordinary Level (O\' Level) passes at least at credit level in not more than two sittings in at least five subjects including English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry, Physics and either Agricultural Science or Biology. b) Obtain Higher National Diploma (HND) with a minimum of Upper Credit from a recognized Institution.', 'This category of admission is to 100 Level and to be qualified, the candidate must satisfy the following conditions: i) Pass in the University Matriculation Examination (UME) conducted by the Joint Admission and Matriculation Board (JAMB) in English Language, Mathematics; Chemistry and Physics. ii) Obtain Ordinary Level (O\'Level) passes at least at credit level at not more than two sittings in at least five subjects including English Language, Mathematics, Chemistry, Physics and either Agricultural Science or Biology.', 'Chemistry, Mathematics and Physics.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26103, 'kwasu', 'aquaculture-and-fisheries-management', 1, 'Aquaculture and Fisheries Management', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '\"A\" Level Passes in the relevant subjects. ND with a minimum of Upper Credit plus 5 Credits in WASCE/NECO/GCE \"O\" Level to be admitted into 200 Level.', 'Credit Passes in 5 WASCE/GCE/NECO Subjects including English, Mathematics, Chemistry, Biology/ Agricultural Science, at least a pass in Physics. The Credit pass in Agric. Science must be backed up by at least a pass in Biology. Universities may determine the level of Credit pass for admission', 'Chemistry, Biology/Agricultural Science and any other Science subject.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26104, 'kwasu', 'taxation', 1, 'Taxation', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Candidates shall in addition to five credit passes in (a) (ii) obtain at least A\' level pass at GCE or equivalent examination in relevant subjects or OND in relevant discipline with at least upper credit grade in addition to the five credit passes as in (a) (ii) above or NCE in relevant discipline with at least a merit grade in addition to the five credit passes as in (a) (ii) above. HND in relevant discipline with at least lower credit in addition to five credit passes as in (a) (ii) above. Final Certificate of relevant Professional Bodies in addition to five credit passes as in (a) (ii) above.', 'Admission into the 100level shall be through the Unified Tertiary Matriculation Examination (UTME) conducted annually by the Joint Admission and Matriculation Board (JAMB) Candidates seeking admission into Kwara State University shall posses a minimum of five credit passes from GCE / SSCE / NECO (or equivalent) in relevant subjects including English Language, Mathematics, Economics and any other two (2) social science subjects in not more than two sittings.', 'Mathematics, Economics, plus any one (1) of Government and Geography.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26105, 'kwasu', 'educational-management', 1, 'Educational Management', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Holders of NCE/Diploma will spend four academic years, while all others will spend five academic years full time. English Language, Mathematics and other Requirements In all cases the following shall apply: At least a pass in Mathematics and Credit in English Language in the Senior Secondary School Exam/West African School Certificate or equivalent for entrants into Educational Management.', 'NCE with an overall pass at MERIT level or above, provided the candidate also has at least five credits in GCE or its equivalent and a credit in Mathematics. Diploma in Education or in any other area provided the candidate also has at least five credits at O\' level including credit in English and in Mathematics at GCE/WAEC/NECO teachers Grade II certificate with a minimum of five passes at merit level including English Language and Mathematics General certificate of Education or its equivalent with at least five credits in two sittings including credit in English and Mathematics.', 'Economics, Mathematics and one (1) other Social Science/Arts subject.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26106, 'kwasu', 'peace-studies-and-conflict-resolution', 1, 'Peace Studies and Conflict Resolution', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'In addition to the O\'level requirements above, candidates for direct entry admissions should possess NCE with at least Merit in 3 relevant subjects, including in Government/History/Social Studies as a major subject; and Diploma (Credit)/OND (Upper Credit)/HND (Lower Credit) in Museum Studies/Tourism & Culture, Mass Communication, Library Studies, Journalism, Public Administration, Law, Islamic Studies, Social Work, Christian Studies, Theatre Arts, International Studies & Diplomacy and related disciplines from a recognized institution. Candidates with IJMB/JUPEB pass in relevant Arts or Social Science subjects will also be considered for admissions.', 'In addition to the general University requirements for University admission, candidates who wish to be admitted into the B.Sc. programme in Peace Studies and Conflict Resolution must have scored the cut-off mark, as set by KWASU, in UTME and should possess a minimum of five (5) O\'level credit passes, including English Language, Mathematics, Government, and two other Arts or Social Science subjects, at not more than 2 sittings.', 'Three (3) Arts or Social Science subjects', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26107, 'kwasu', 'arabic-education', 1, 'Arabic Education', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 'In addition to the general University requirements for University admission, candidates who wish to be admitted into the B.A. programme in Arabic and should possess a minimum of credit pass in 5 subjects, including Arabic, English, taken at the WASSCE, NECO, GCE O Level or their equivalent at not more than 2 sittings for UTME candidates. However, tested products of Pre-degree French from a recognized University and who are qualified may be considered.', 'Arabic and any two (2) relevant Arts/Social Science subjects.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26109, 'kwasu', 'english-education', 1, 'English Education', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '3 or 2 credits in NCE teaching subjects in addition the general requirements of Credit in English Language and Literature.', 'Five credits at the senior secondary school certificate including English language and literature or Merit in 5 relevant subject at the Teachers Grade II Certificate.', 'Literature in English and one (1) Art and any other subject.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26110, 'kwasu', 'french-education', 1, 'French Education', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 'In addition to the general University requirements for University admission, candidates who wish to be admitted into the B.A. programme in French and should possess a minimum of credit pass in 5 subjects, including French, English, taken at the WASSCE, NECO, GCE O Level or their equivalent at not more than 2 sittings for UTME candidates. However, tested products of Pre-degree French from a recognized University and who are qualified may be considered.', 'rench plus two (2) other Arts subjects.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26111, 'kwasu', 'islamic-studies-education', 1, 'Islamic Studies / Education', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'University diploma whose duration is three years may be considered for entry. In addition, all candidates must obtain credit in English at the Senior Secondary School Certificate Level or its equivalent.', 'Five credits at the Senior Secondary School Certificate, one of which must be in Islam Religious knowledge or Grade II Teacher\'s Certificate with five Merits in the relevant subjects including Islamic studies.', 'Islamic Studies/Arabic and two (2) other Social Science or Arts subjects.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26112, 'kwasu', 'agricultural-education', 1, 'Agricultural Education', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A pass at merit level in Agriculture or related subjects provided the SSCE requirements are met. Advanced level passes in 2 of Biology, Agricultural Science and chemistry. The SSCE, equivalent requirements must be met. NCE with at an overall pass at merit level in Agricultural Science as a double major or in combination with relevant subject. IJMB passes in 2 of Biology, Agricultural Science and Chemistry with the SSCE requirements satisfied Any other equivalent qualifications In addition to the general requirements for graduation at the University, students of Agricultural Education must offer and pass courses totaling 150 credit hours for the five years programme or 120 credit hours in case of four years programme. They must also complete and receive a pass grade in Teaching Practical and a research project report on a topic approved by the Department.', 'Five credit passes in SSCE or equivalent in Biology/ Agricultural Science, chemistry, economics, physics, English language and mathematics.', 'Any three (3) subjects from Chemistry, Biology, Agriculture, Physics, Economics, Geography and Mathematics.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26113, 'kwasu', 'biology-education', 1, 'Biology Education', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A pass at merit level in relevant Diploma programme (provided the SSCE requirements are met). Advanced level passes in 2 relevant subjects with SSCE requirements NCE with at least merit pass in 2 relevant subjects or a double major subject with SSCE requirements. IJMB passes in 2 relevant subject with SSCE requirements Any other equivalent qualifications with SSCE requirements. Any other equivalent qualifications.', 'Five credit passes in SSCE or equivalents in Biology, Chemistry, Physics, Mathematics and English Language.', 'Biology and two (2) other subjects from Chemistry, Mathematics and Physics.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26114, 'kwasu', 'chemistry-education', 1, 'Chemistry Education', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A pass at merit level in relevant Diploma programme (provided the SSCE requirements are met). Advanced level passes in 2 relevant subjects with SSCE requirements NCE with at least merit pass in 2 relevant subjects or a double major subject with SSCE requirements. IJMB passes in 2 relevant subject with SSCE requirements Any other equivalent qualifications with SSCE requirements. Any other equivalent qualifications.', 'Five credit passes in SSCE or equivalents in Biology, Chemistry, Physics, Mathematics and English Language.', 'Chemistry and two (2) other subjects chosen from Physics, Biology and Mathematics.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26115, 'kwasu', 'computer-science-education', 1, 'Computer Science /  Education', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A pass at merit level in relevant Diploma programme (provided the SSCE requirements are met). Advanced level passes in 2 relevant subjects with SSCE requirements NCE with at least merit pass in 2 relevant subjects or a double major subject with SSCE requirements. IJMB passes in 2 relevant subject with SSCE requirements Any other equivalent qualifications with SSCE requirements. Any other equivalent qualifications.', 'Five credit passes in SSCE or equivalents in Biology, Chemistry, Physics, Mathematics and English Language.', 'Mathematics, Physics and one of Biology, Chemistry and Geography.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26116, 'kwasu', 'mathematics-education', 1, 'Mathematics Education', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A pass at merit level in relevant Diploma programme (provided the SSCE requirements are met). Advanced level passes in 2 relevant subjects with SSCE requirements NCE with at least merit pass in 2 relevant subjects or a double major subject with SSCE requirements. IJMB passes in 2 relevant subject with SSCE requirements Any other equivalent qualifications with SSCE requirements. Any other equivalent qualifications.', 'Five credit passes in SSCE or equivalents in Biology, Chemistry, Physics, Mathematics and English Language.', 'Mathematics and any two (2) of the following Science subjects: Physics, Chemistry and Biology.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26117, 'kwasu', 'physics-education', 1, 'Physics / Education', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'A pass at merit level in relevant Diploma programme (provided the SSCE requirements are met). Advanced level passes in 2 relevant subjects with SSCE requirements NCE with at least merit pass in 2 relevant subjects or a double major subject with SSCE requirements. IJMB passes in 2 relevant subject with SSCE requirements Any other equivalent qualifications with SSCE requirements. Any other equivalent qualifications.', 'Five credit passes in SSCE or equivalents in Biology, Chemistry, Physics, Mathematics and English Language.', 'Physics, Mathematics or Chemistry plus one (1) other subjects.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26118, 'kwasu', 'yoruba-education', 1, 'Yoruba Education', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 'candidates must have five credit passes at the senior secondary school certificate including English language and literature or Merit in 5 relevant subject at the Teachers Grade II Certificate.', 'Yoruba and any two (2) subjects chosen from History, Literature in English, French, Christian Religious Studies, Islamic Studies, Arabic, Geography and Physics.', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26119, 'kwasu', 'medicine-and-surgery', 1, 'Medicine and Surgery', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Candidates who possess very good grades in Physics, Chemistry and Biology (Zoology) at Advanced Level and credits in English Language and Mathematics at Ordinary Level at one sitting will be admitted into the programme at 200 Level. Candidates with degrees in health- related courses may be admitted with a minimum degree classification of Second-Class Lower may be admitted into 200 Level. Candidates that excel in 100 Level from other related programmes (Anatomy, Physiology, Biochemistry and Dentistry) may be considered for transfer into the programme at 200 Level.', 'Senior Secondary Certificate with credit in Physics, Chemistry, Biology, Mathematics and English Language obtained at not more than one sitting. UTME subjects are English Language, Biology, Physics and Chemistry.', 'Biology, Physics and Chemistry', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(26140, 'clifford', 'environmental-health-science', 1, 'Environmental Health Science', NULL, NULL, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '', '', '', 1, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
